| **2. Put the exact dare inside every clip** | Keep the **720A-1280** vertical replay and the one-seat-left opener. Burn a short, typeable challenge URL into a safe strip for the **entire 6�?"9 second clip**. Add a QR to the same exact board, seat count, and goal on the **final 3 seconds** and on the PNG fallback. A compact versioned token carries the challenge without a URL-shortening service. | The opening, peak, end card, and fallback PNG all carry the URL. At **360 px wide**, the URL is readable and the QR scans from a chat-transcoded copy. The decoded board, seats, and goal agree with the caption. Share targets can discard accompanying fields, which is why the link belongs in the image itself. [Web Share API share-target behavior](https://www.w3.org/TR/web-share/#share-targets) |
